(117,'PSI-26','2013-05-17',108.0,'2 cm sphere','20-11',2.0,17.169999999999998,0.98,'1.9','new igniter, anneal it.  3 min to ignite,  turned flow to 7 cm/s, let it wrap around sphere, then reduced flow to < 1 cm/s.   All blue flame.  Nice video from the over the shoulder view.    Sphere is very flat on front,w ith blackened bubble layer extending past 90 degreees on the sphere.  Back ~40% of sphere still fairly pristine.',1,0,0),
(118,'PSI-26','2013-05-17',109.0,'2 cm sphere','20-11',2.0,17.169999999999998,0.98,'1.9','nice over the shoulder view, very hard to see dim flame in expt video.  Ignition in 1.5 min.   ',1,0,0),
(119,'PSI-26','2013-05-17',110.0,'2 cm sphere','20-11',2.0,17.24,0.98,'1.9','stills during ignition.flame ignited over lower part of sphere, wrapped around and then decreased flow to near limit flow, flame shrank forward and oscillated slightly at pot 0.35,  went out when pot turned down to 0.29.',1,0,1),
(120,'PSI-26','2013-06-01',111.0,'2 cm sphere','20-11',2.0,17.24,0.98,'1.9','got dim flame with stills during ignition, then had Chris do incr and decr flow flame got very long soot tail at  around 10 cm/s and dim blue spherical flame at really low flows.  Flame went out at pot 0.27, with oscillations and a big flash at extinction.',1,0,1),
(121,'PSI-26','2013-06-01',112.0,'flat wax slab','20-13',2.0,17.4,0.9963,'2.3','igniter 20-11 wass reported broken when he was getting it ready.  Tested 20-132 and it was fine.  Sample ignited briefly - blue curving around leading edge, but went out.  Couldn\'t get it ignited again at leading edge.   Adjusted igniter dcownstream.  No luck.  No stills taken.',1,0,1),
